  "review": "<div class=\"my-6 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-900 via-indigo-900 to-slate-900 text-white shadow-md flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3\">\n  <div class=\"space-y-0.5 text-center sm:text-left\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-1.5 text-amber-300 font-extrabold text-xs\">\n      <span>❄️</span><span>2026年 冬〜年末年始旅行の予約速報</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-200\">\n      冬の味覚解禁（カニ・ふぐ・寒ブリ）や雪見露天・年末年始の宿泊枠は例年10月中旬〜11月上旬で満室が急増します。空室状況はお早めに確認を。\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F30109%2F30109.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"shrink-0 px-4 py-2 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-stone-950 font-black text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition transform hover:scale-105\">\n    🏨 47都道府県を代表する最高峰温泉名宿セレクションのリアルタイム空室＆極上名湯・にごり湯プラン →\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026】47日本各地といえばコレ！有名なもの・名物グルメ・絶景＆全国おすすめ名宿セレクション</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 via-emerald-50/40 to-stone-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 flex items-center gap-2\">🗾 日本全国の名物・絶景・文化を旅する総合ガイド</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">北海道のパウダースノーと海鮮丼、東北の秘湯と地酒、信州・甲州の山並みとフルーツ、北陸の海の幸、関西の歴史遺産、四国・山陰の絶景、九州の名湯、沖縄のエメラルドブルー。各地域を代表する最高峰の名宿とともに日本の美しさを再発見できます。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 日本を代表する東西南北の最高峰名宿</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">登別温泉　第一滝本館</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.55</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/30109/30109.jpg\" alt=\"登別温泉　第一滝本館 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 【北海道といえば登別温泉】地獄谷を望む1500坪の大浴場と5つの泉質巡り！</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">日本屈指の温泉天国・登別温泉の元祖。広大な大浴場で硫黄泉や食塩泉など5つの異なる泉質を堪能。北海道の蟹やいくら、白老牛ビュッフェが圧巻。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>ファミリー、三世代、温泉好き、北海道を代表する名湯を満喫したい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>地獄谷の絶景と5つの泉質を誇るメガ大浴場なら迷わずここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F30109%2F30109.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】登別温泉　第一滝本館 の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第2位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">蔵王温泉　蔵王国際ホテル</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.75</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/5723/5723.jpg\" alt=\"蔵王温泉　蔵王国際ホテル 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 【山形といえば蔵王温泉】100%源泉掛け流し強酸性硫黄泉の「八右衛門の湯」</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">丸太造りの開放的な大浴場と乳白色のにごり湯露天風呂。山形牛ステーキや芋煮、山形の地酒とともに極上の東北温泉旅を演出。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>ご夫婦、シニア、本格硫黄泉と山形牛を味わいたい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>乳白色のにごり湯と極上山形牛ならここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F5723%2F5723.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】蔵王温泉　蔵王国際ホテル の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white 